### H1 (sent first, but the LATEST time)
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047", "timeStamp": "2026-10-17T10:03:00Z", "value": { "watts": 300 } }

### H2 (sent second, the EARLIEST time)
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047", "timeStamp": "2026-10-17T10:01:00Z", "value": { "watts": 100 } }

### H3 (sent third, the MIDDLE time)
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047", "timeStamp": "2026-10-17T10:02:00Z", "value": { "watts": 200 } }

### Timeline, sorted by time
GET http://localhost:5056/history/a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047

### Arrival order, for contrast
GET http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical


### T1. since: only readings at or after 10:02  (expect 200 and 300, count 2)
GET http://localhost:5056/history/a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047?since=2026-10-17T10:02:00Z

### T2. until: only readings at or before 10:01:30  (expect only 100, count 1)
GET http://localhost:5056/history/a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047?until=2026-10-17T10:01:30Z

### T3. limit: only the latest 1 reading  (expect only 300, count 1)
GET http://localhost:5056/history/a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047?limit=1

### T4. window: since AND until together  (expect only 200, count 1)
GET http://localhost:5056/history/a9c7c8d8-d7d9-4fec-97b9-c6d1f27df047?since=2026-10-17T10:01:30Z&until=2026-10-17T10:02:30Z

### T5. unknown sensor  (expect 404 with "Sensor not found.")
GET http://localhost:5056/history/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001